# TeaVM bundle size budget: max allowed bytes per generated bundle.
# The build FAILS when a bundle exceeds these. After a deliberate size
# change, regenerate with the updateBundleBudget task and commit.
# measured= is the size this ceiling was derived from, so the next
# breach can report how much the bundle GREW since this baseline.
# 2026-09-28: hawkeye's render-error containment gives every generated template region its own catch (the
# generated template packages dominate the growth): raw 6046963 -> 6572760, gzip 1425643 -> 1523166.
# 2026-10-01: module-fit stages 1-2 (principal kinds, registries, the common activity action members and their
# legacy keys in the StoredIds holders): raw 6572760 -> 6746997, gzip 1523166 -> 1599874.
cms.js.raw=7476989 measured=7120941
cms.js.gzip=1771200 measured=1686857
